Package: replaykit
Version: @@VERSION@@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @@ARCH@@
Depends: libgl1, libglib2.0-0, libxcb1, libxkbcommon0
Recommends: scrcpy, ffmpeg, android-tools-adb, python3-tk, fonts-noto-cjk, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good
Maintainer: choi3206@gmail.com
Homepage: https://github.com/choisjin/ReplayKit_Dev_For_Linux
Description: ReplayKit - Android automation testing tool (Linux port)
 Replay/record Android device interactions with OCR-based UI validation.
 Bundles a self-contained Python runtime (python-build-standalone) so it
 does not depend on the system Python installation.
 .
 System tools that this package recommends (scrcpy, ffmpeg, adb) are used
 for screen capture, video encoding and device control respectively.
